Mistake: B054
Class: K9
Fix: 84253b30
Browser: yes
Seen: In the desktop window the pop-up's top right corner sits under the window's own buttons.
Note: the pop-up is placed 40 px from the top again instead of clearing the header

diff --git a/apps/web/src/lib/ui/panel.css b/apps/web/src/lib/ui/panel.css
index b8503bf0..9778b14c 100644
--- a/apps/web/src/lib/ui/panel.css
+++ b/apps/web/src/lib/ui/panel.css
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
 /* In the desktop window the window's own buttons are an opaque box in the top right corner, as
    tall as the header. The pop-up stays 8 px under it (and as far from the bottom, so it stays
    centred): at 40 px the buttons covered the pop-up's corner in any window under 1064 px tall. */
-.wco .dlg{height:min(calc(100dvh - 2*(var(--header-h) + 8px)),960px)}
+.wco .dlg{height:min(calc(100dvh - 80px),960px)}
 /* the box takes focus so a key lands inside; it is not a control, so no ring (Ctrl+, drew one) */
 .dlg[tabindex]:focus-visible{outline:none}
 /* the header is one 48 px row: the title at the left, the controls, Close at the right end */
